- Journal #2968 (kmt2c-kdm6a-epigenetic-dependency-atlas):
  - **Foundational literature bundle for NEW project.** (a) Kmt2c/Kmt2d loss primes urothelium, confers EGFR inhibitor vulnerability (Nat Genet Jan 2025, PMID 39806204). (b) KMT2C loss → PARP SL (EMBO Rep, PMID 30665945). (c) KDM6A loss → EZH2i sensitivity in bladder/MM. (d) Kmt2c/d loss drives brain metastasis via KDM6A-dependent MMP3 (Nat Cell Biol 2024).
- Journal #2969 (pancancer-ferroptosis-atlas):
  - **CRITICAL: Extracellular GPX4 is immunosuppressive DAMP** (Cell Jan 2026, PMID 41494530 + Cell Death Differ 2026). Ferroptotic cancer cells release GPX4 → binds ZP3 on DCs → suppresses antitumor immunity. Complicates GPX4-targeting strategies. FSP1-targeting may be preferred.
